WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a seated twist, hook one leg high over the same-side shoulder.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Cross the ankles and squeeze the legs together around the upper arm.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Plant both hands shoulder-width apart, fingers spread wide.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Lean forward, bend the elbows, and float the hips up and the legs out to the side.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Straighten the arms as much as you can, then lower with control.
